# Necklace of Breeze → Speed II
/effect give @a[scores={necklace=1}] speed 2 1 true

# Necklace of Immortality → Regeneration II
/effect give @a[scores={necklace=2}] regeneration 2 1 true

# Necklace of Jungle → Strength I + Haste II
